  "query_preview": "forecast period. This will retain pleasant weather\nunder its reign, featuring mostly clear skies and seasonable\ndaytime temperatures. Overnight conditions will be much of the\nsame each night, with river valley fog and patchy frost\npotential. For this evening, did not see any evidence for\nfrost/freeze products needed in our remaining growing season\nzones.\n\nForecast soundings continue to show a vast layer of dry air\nparked over the region, which remains the main forecast\nchallenge of this weather pattern. Central guidance continues to\ncome in too high with forecast dew points, so opted to blend in\nhigher resolution models that capture this afternoon drop into\nthe 20s/30s each afternoon through the next few days. Otherwise,\nthe forecast outlook remains on track from previous discussions.",
